  {
   "id": "matematicas-2019-reserva-1-6",
   "n": 6,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sean las funciones \\(f,g:[0,\\pi]\\to\\mathbb R\\) definidas por \\(f(x)=\\mathrm{sen}(x)\\) y \\(g(x)=\\mathrm{sen}(2x)\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Esboza sus gráficas en unos mismos ejes coordenados y calcula sus puntos de corte.",
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula el área del recinto limitado por ambas gráficas y las rectas \\(x=0\\) y \\(x=\\frac\\pi3\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>En \\([0,\\pi]\\), \\(\\mathrm{sen}\\,x\\ge0\\) con máximo 1 en \\(\\frac\\pi2\\); \\(\\mathrm{sen}\\,2x\\) completa un periodo: es positiva en \\(\\left(0,\\frac\\pi2\\right)\\), con máximo 1 en \\(\\frac\\pi4\\), y negativa en \\(\\left(\\frac\\pi2,\\pi\\right)\\).</p><p><b>Puntos de corte:</b></p>\\[\\mathrm{sen}\\,2x=\\mathrm{sen}\\,x\\iff2\\,\\mathrm{sen}\\,x\\cos x-\\mathrm{sen}\\,x=0\\iff\\mathrm{sen}\\,x\\,(2\\cos x-1)=0\\]<p>\\(\\mathrm{sen}\\,x=0\\iff x=0\\) o \\(x=\\pi\\); \\(\\cos x=\\frac12\\iff x=\\frac\\pi3\\) (en \\([0,\\pi]\\)).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 200' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='34.4,103.3 36.3,99.8 38.2,96.4 40.1,92.9 42.0,89.5 43.9,86.1 45.8,82.7 47.7,79.4 49.6,76.2 51.5,73.1 53.4,70.0 55.2,67.0 57.1,64.1 59.0,61.4 60.9,58.7 62.8,56.2 64.7,53.8 66.6,51.5 68.5,49.4 70.4,47.4 72.3,45.6 74.2,43.9 76.0,42.4 77.9,41.1 79.8,39.9 81.7,38.9 83.6,38.1 85.5,37.5 87.4,37.0 89.3,36.8 91.2,36.7 93.1,36.8 94.9,37.0 96.8,37.5 98.7,38.1 100.6,38.9 102.5,39.9 104.4,41.1 106.3,42.4 108.2,43.9 110.1,45.6 110.1,45.6 108.2,46.5 106.3,47.4 104.4,48.4 102.5,49.4 100.6,50.4 98.7,51.5 96.8,52.6 94.9,53.8 93.1,55.0 91.2,56.2 89.3,57.4 87.4,58.7 85.5,60.0 83.6,61.4 81.7,62.7 79.8,64.1 77.9,65.6 76.0,67.0 74.2,68.5 72.3,70.0 70.4,71.5 68.5,73.1 66.6,74.6 64.7,76.2 62.8,77.8 60.9,79.4 59.0,81.1 57.1,82.7 55.2,84.4 53.4,86.1 51.5,87.8 49.6,89.5 47.7,91.2 45.8,92.9 43.9,94.6 42.0,96.4 40.1,98.1 38.2,99.8 36.3,101.6 34.4,103.3' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='34.4,103.3 38.2,99.8 42.0,96.4 45.8,92.9 49.6,89.5 53.4,86.1 57.1,82.7 60.9,79.4 64.7,76.2 68.5,73.1 72.3,70.0 76.0,67.0 79.8,64.1 83.6,61.4 87.4,58.7 91.2,56.2 94.9,53.8 98.7,51.5 102.5,49.4 106.3,47.4 110.1,45.6 113.9,43.9 117.6,42.4 121.4,41.1 125.2,39.9 129.0,38.9 132.8,38.1 136.5,37.5 140.3,37.0 144.1,36.8 147.9,36.7 151.7,36.8 155.5,37.0 159.2,37.5 163.0,38.1 166.8,38.9 170.6,39.9 174.4,41.1 178.1,42.4 181.9,43.9 185.7,45.6 189.5,47.4 193.3,49.4 197.1,51.5 200.8,53.8 204.6,56.2 208.4,58.7 212.2,61.4 216.0,64.1 219.7,67.0 223.5,70.0 227.3,73.1 231.1,76.2 234.9,79.4 238.6,82.7 242.4,86.1 246.2,89.5 250.0,92.9 253.8,96.4 257.6,99.8 261.3,103.3' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='34.4,103.3 37.3,98.1 40.1,92.9 43.0,87.8 45.8,82.7 48.6,77.8 51.5,73.1 54.3,68.5 57.1,64.1 60.0,60.0 62.8,56.2 65.6,52.6 68.5,49.4 71.3,46.5 74.2,43.9 77.0,41.7 79.8,39.9 82.7,38.5 85.5,37.5 88.3,36.9 91.2,36.7 94.0,36.9 96.8,37.5 99.7,38.5 102.5,39.9 105.3,41.7 108.2,43.9 111.0,46.5 113.9,49.4 116.7,52.6 119.5,56.2 122.4,60.0 125.2,64.1 128.0,68.5 130.9,73.1 133.7,77.8 136.5,82.7 139.4,87.8 142.2,92.9 145.1,98.1 147.9,103.3 150.7,108.6 153.6,113.8 156.4,118.9 159.2,123.9 162.1,128.8 164.9,133.6 167.7,138.2 170.6,142.5 173.4,146.6 176.3,150.5 179.1,154.0 181.9,157.3 184.8,160.2 187.6,162.7 190.4,164.9 193.3,166.7 196.1,168.2 198.9,169.2 201.8,169.8 204.6,170.0 207.5,169.8 210.3,169.2 213.1,168.2 216.0,166.7 218.8,164.9 221.6,162.7 224.5,160.2 227.3,157.3 230.1,154.0 233.0,150.5 235.8,146.6 238.6,142.5 241.5,138.2 244.3,133.6 247.2,128.8 250.0,123.9 252.8,118.9 255.7,113.8 258.5,108.6 261.3,103.3' fill='none' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='110.1' y1='103.3' x2='110.1' y2='45.6' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><circle cx='110.1' cy='45.6' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='116.1' y='39.6'>(π/3, √3/2)</text><circle cx='261.3' cy='103.3' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='251.3' y='117.3'>(π,0)</text><text x='150.0' y='28.7' fill='#2f6df0' font-size='10'>f(x) = sen x</text><text x='193.3' y='166.7' fill='#e8487a' font-size='10'>g(x) = sen 2x</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 103.3H294.0M34.4 194.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='106.7' y1='100.3' x2='106.7' y2='106.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='103.7' y='117.3' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='178.9' y1='100.3' x2='178.9' y2='106.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='175.9' y='117.3' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='251.1' y1='100.3' x2='251.1' y2='106.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='248.1' y='117.3' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='31.4' y1='170.0' x2='37.4' y2='170.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='18.4' y='174.0' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='31.4' y1='36.7' x2='37.4' y2='36.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='18.4' y='40.7' font-size='10'>1</text></svg></div><div class='res'>Se cortan en \\((0,0)\\), \\(\\left(\\dfrac\\pi3,\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}2\\right)\\) y \\((\\pi,0)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Entre \\(0\\) y \\(\\frac\\pi3\\) la gráfica de \\(\\mathrm{sen}\\,2x\\) va por encima<i class='n' data-t='tp'>En \\(x=\\frac\\pi6\\): \\(\\mathrm{sen}\\frac\\pi3\\approx0{,}87\\gt\\mathrm{sen}\\frac\\pi6=0{,}5\\).</i>:</p>\\[A=\\int_0^{\\pi/3}(\\mathrm{sen}\\,2x-\\mathrm{sen}\\,x)\\,dx=\\Bigl[-\\frac{\\cos2x}2+\\cos x\\Bigr]_0^{\\pi/3}\\]\\[A=\\left(\\frac14+\\frac12\\right)-\\left(-\\frac12+1\\right)=\\frac34-\\frac12=\\frac14\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac14\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "area",
     "apartados": "a, b"
    }
   ],
