    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(a=2\\), \\(\\overrightarrow{AB}=(0,-2,3)\\). El plano buscado contiene a \\(\\overrightarrow{AB}\\) y, por ser perpendicular a \\(\\pi\\), contiene al normal de \\(\\pi\\), \\((1,-1,1)\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si dos planos son perpendiculares, el vector normal de uno es paralelo al otro.</i>. Su vector normal es perpendicular a ambos:</p>\\[\\vec n_\\sigma=\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\vec n_\\pi=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\0&-2&3\\\\1&-1&1\\end{vmatrix}=(1,\\,3,\\,2)\\]<p>El plano es de la forma \\(x+3y+2z+D=0\\) y como contiene a \\(A(0,3,-1)\\): \\(0+9-2+D=0\\iff D=-7\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":12,\"el\":16,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[2.213,1.843,-0.37],[-0.873,1.225,2.099],[-2.605,2.957,0.366],[0.481,3.575,-2.102]],\"#fcd9a8\",\"#c2410c\"],[\"txt\",[-2.605,2.957,0.366],\"σ\",\"#c2410c\",4,0],[\"poly\",[[2.213,1.843,-0.37],[-0.873,1.225,2.099],[-0.232,3.15,3.381],[2.854,3.767,0.913]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[-0.232,3.15,3.381],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[0,3,-1],[0,1,2],\"#334155\",2.0,false],[\"pt\",[0,3,-1],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,1,2],\"B\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m19r1b4cn' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m19r1b4cd' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m19r1b4cg' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m19r1b4cr' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='41.1,192.1 42.7,57.5 128.1,111.4 126.5,246.0' fill='#fcd9a8' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#c2410c' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='132.1' y='111.4' fill='#c2410c' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>σ</text><polygon points='41.1,192.1 42.7,57.5 115.4,18.0 113.8,152.6' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='119.4' y='18.0' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><line x1='107.3' y1='195.2' x2='26.0' y2='70.6' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='2.0'/><circle cx='107.3' cy='195.2' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='114.3' y='189.2' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='26.0' cy='70.6' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='33.0' y='64.6' font-weight='700'>B</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='20.7' y2='274.3' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='16.5' y='279.8' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='39.7' y2='270.9' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='42.1' y='275.2' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='254.6' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='253.2' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(\\sigma\\equiv x+3y+2z-7=0\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(B(0,1,2)\\): \\(0+3+4-7=0\\) ✓; \\((1,3,2)\\cdot(1,-1,1)=0\\) ✓.</i></div>"
